"計算時間が増えるほか、記事の既約k点の数と比べられなくなります。"
msgstr ""
"**\"Using Symmetry\" is Off by default.** If you leave it Off, Quloud "
"writes ``nosym = .true.`` to the QE input, so QE does not use crystal "
"symmetry to reduce the mesh to its irreducible k-points (:numref:`Section"
" {number} <sec-kp-irreducible>` of :doc:`kpoint_convergence`). \\ This "
"increases the computation time and prevents you from comparing your "
"irreducible k-point counts with those in the article."

