#: ../../kpoints/reproduction.rst:139
msgid "1. Cuの計算"
msgstr "1. Calculations for Cu"

#: ../../kpoints/reproduction.rst:141
msgid ""
"``cu_fcc_a3.64.cif`` などを登録したMaterialで、上の設定のJobを作り、実行します。\\ k "
"グリッドを変えたJobを、調べたいメッシュの数だけ作ります。\\ Quloudは、3辺が等しく角が60°のセルを、QEの入力で ``ibrav ="
" 2`` （fcc）、 ``A`` = 立方晶の格子定数（Å）として書きます。\\ 例えば、3.64 Å、 :math:`12^3` "
"のJobの入力ファイル ``QuloudJob.scf.in`` は次のようになります。"
msgstr ""
"Create and run a Job with the settings above for a Material registered "
"from a file such as ``cu_fcc_a3.64.cif``. \\ Create one Job for each mesh"
" you want to test, varying \"k-grid (a-, b-, c-axis)\". \\ For a cell "
"with three edges of equal length and angles of 60° between them, Quloud "
"writes ``ibrav = 2`` (fcc) in the QE input and sets ``A`` equal to the "
"cubic lattice constant (Å). \\ For example, for the Job at 3.64 Å with a "
":math:`12^3` mesh, the input file ``QuloudJob.scf.in`` looks like this."

#: ../../kpoints/reproduction.rst:146
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"&control\n"
" calculation = 'scf'\n"
" prefix = 'QuloudJob'\n"
" tstress = .true.\n"
" tprnfor = .true.\n"
" pseudo_dir = './'\n"
" outdir = './work'\n"
" verbosity = 'high'\n"
"/\n"
"&system\n"
" nat = 1\n"
" ntyp = 1\n"
" ibrav = 2\n"
" A = 3.639999995023336\n"
" ecutwfc = 60.0\n"
" ecutrho = 600.0\n"
" occupations = 'smearing'\n"
" smearing = 'marzari-vanderbilt'\n"
" degauss = 0.020000\n"
"/\n"
"&electrons\n"
" electron_maxstep = 100\n"
" conv_thr = 1.00e-12\n"
" diagonalization = 'david'\n"
"/\n"
"ATOMIC_SPECIES\n"
"Cu 63.546 Cu.pbe-dn-kjpaw_psl.1.0.0.UPF\n"
"ATOMIC_POSITIONS {crystal}\n"
"Cu 0.0 0.0 0.0\n"
"K_POINTS automatic\n"
"12 12 12 0 0 0"
msgstr ""
"&control\n"
" calculation = 'scf'\n"
" prefix = 'QuloudJob'\n"
" tstress = .true.\n"
" tprnfor = .true.\n"
" pseudo_dir = './'\n"
" outdir = './work'\n"
" verbosity = 'high'\n"
"/\n"
"&system\n"
" nat = 1\n"
" ntyp = 1\n"
" ibrav = 2\n"
" A = 3.639999995023336\n"
" ecutwfc = 60.0\n"
" ecutrho = 600.0\n"
" occupations = 'smearing'\n"
" smearing = 'marzari-vanderbilt'\n"
" degauss = 0.020000\n"
"/\n"
"&electrons\n"
" electron_maxstep = 100\n"
" conv_thr = 1.00e-12\n"
" diagonalization = 'david'\n"
"/\n"
"ATOMIC_SPECIES\n"
"Cu 63.546 Cu.pbe-dn-kjpaw_psl.1.0.0.UPF\n"
"ATOMIC_POSITIONS {crystal}\n"
"Cu 0.0 0.0 0.0\n"
"K_POINTS automatic\n"
"12 12 12 0 0 0"

#: ../../kpoints/reproduction.rst:180
msgid ""
"``tstress = .true.`` により、出力に応力と圧力（ ``P=`` ）が書かれます。\\ ``verbosity = "
"'high'`` により、既約k点の座標と重みの一覧が出力に書かれます（記事の :numref:`tab-kp-irreducible-4` ）。"
msgstr ""
"With ``tstress = .true.``, the output includes the stress and pressure "
"(``P=``). \\ ``verbosity = 'high'`` adds the coordinates and weights of "
"the irreducible k-points (see :numref:`tab-kp-irreducible-4` in the "
"article)."

#: ../../kpoints/reproduction.rst:184
msgid "2. Siの計算（固定占有）"
msgstr "2. Calculations for Si (Fixed Occupations)"

#: ../../kpoints/reproduction.rst:186
msgid ""
"``si_diamond_a5.47.cif`` などを登録したMaterialで、Cuと同じ設定のJobを作ります。\\ "
"「電子占有数スメアリング」の選択肢には「なし（固定占有）」がなく、どれかを選ぶと入力にスメアリングの行が書き込まれます。\\ "
"Siは固定占有で計算するので、 **Jobを登録したら、実行する前に入力ファイル** ``QuloudJob.scf.in`` "
"**から次の3行を削除します。**"
msgstr ""
"Create a Job with the same settings as for Cu, using a Material "
"registered from a file such as ``si_diamond_a5.47.cif``. \\ There is no "
"option for no smearing (fixed occupations) under \"Electronic occupation "
"number smearing\". Selecting any of the available options writes smearing"
" lines to the input. \\ For Si, use fixed occupations. To do so, **after "
"registering the Job, delete the following 3 lines from the input file** "
"``QuloudJob.scf.in`` **before running the Job.**"

#: ../../kpoints/reproduction.rst:190 ../../kpoints/reproduction.rst:206
msgid ""
"occupations = 'smearing'\n"
"smearing = 'marzari-vanderbilt'\n"
"degauss = 0.020000"
msgstr ""
"occupations = 'smearing'\n"
"smearing = 'marzari-vanderbilt'\n"
"degauss = 0.020000"

#: ../../kpoints/reproduction.rst:196
msgid ""
"Status が「Registered」のJobは、Job詳細画面の「ファイル」で入力ファイルを直接編集できます（マニュアルの `Job の詳細 "
"<https://manual.quloud-platform.quemix.com/source/jobdetail.html>`__ "
"の章）。\\ 3行を削除すると、QEは既定の固定占有（ ``occupations = 'fixed'`` ）で計算します。\\ "
"3行を残したまま（MVスメアリング0.02 Ry）計算すると、格子定数5.469 Å・ :math:`8^3` "
"の確認計算で、全エネルギーが固定占有より約1.5 mRy高く、圧力が約1.2 kbar大きくなりました。"
msgstr ""
"When a Job's \"Status\" is \"Registered\", you can edit its input file "
"directly in the \"Files\" tab of the Job details page (see the section on"
" `viewing Job details <https://manual.quloud-"
"platform.quemix.com/source/jobdetail.html>`__ in the manual). \\ Deleting"
" the 3 lines makes QE use its default fixed occupations (``occupations = "
"'fixed'``). \\ In a check at a lattice constant of 5.469 Å and an "
":math:`8^3` mesh, leaving the 3 lines in place (MV smearing at 0.02 Ry) "
"raised the total energy by about 1.5 mRy and the pressure by about 1.2 "
"kbar compared with fixed occupations."

#: ../../kpoints/reproduction.rst:201
msgid "3. Cuのテトラヘドロン法"
msgstr "3. Tetrahedron Method for Cu"

#: ../../kpoints/reproduction.rst:203
msgid ""
"Cuの計算と同じ設定のJobを作ります。\\ 「電子占有数スメアリング」の選択肢にはテトラヘドロン法がないので、Siと同じく、 "
"**Jobを登録したら、実行する前に入力ファイル** ``QuloudJob.scf.in`` **の次の3行を書き換えます。**"
msgstr ""
"Create a Job with the same settings as for the Cu calculation. \\ The "
"tetrahedron method is unavailable under \"Electronic occupation number "
"smearing\", so follow the same procedure as for Si and **replace these 3 "
"lines in the input file** ``QuloudJob.scf.in`` **after registering the "
"Job and before running it.**"

#: ../../kpoints/reproduction.rst:212
msgid "この3行を、Blöchlの方法なら次の1行に、"
msgstr "For Blöchl's method, replace the 3 lines with this line."

#: ../../kpoints/reproduction.rst:214
msgid "occupations = 'tetrahedra'"
msgstr "occupations = 'tetrahedra'"

#: ../../kpoints/reproduction.rst:218
msgid "最適化テトラヘドロン法なら次の1行にします。"
msgstr "For the optimized tetrahedron method, use this line instead."

#: ../../kpoints/reproduction.rst:220
msgid "occupations = 'tetrahedra_opt'"
msgstr "occupations = 'tetrahedra_opt'"

#: ../../kpoints/reproduction.rst:224
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"テトラヘドロン法は、 ``K_POINTS automatic`` で指定した規則的なメッシュでしか使えません。Quloudの「k "
"グリッド」はこの形式で書かれるので、そのままで構いません。\\ 出力には、応力の計算を推奨しないという警告（ ``BEWARE: stress "
"calculation with tetrahedra (not recommanded)`` ）が書かれますが、計算は最後まで行われます（記事の"
" :numref:`{number}節 <sec-kp-tetra>` ）。\\ テトラヘドロン法は細かいメッシュで時間がかかり、 "
":math:`48^3` ではMPI 4並列で約9分でした（MVスメアリングでは約2分）。"
msgstr ""
"The tetrahedron method works only with a regular mesh specified by "
"``K_POINTS automatic``. Quloud writes the mesh from \"k-grid (a-, b-, "
"c-axis)\" in this format, so you can leave it as is. \\ The output "
"includes a warning advising against stress calculations (``BEWARE: stress"
" calculation with tetrahedra (not recommanded)``), but the calculation "
"runs to completion (see :numref:`Section {number} <sec-kp-tetra>` of the "
"article). \\ The tetrahedron method takes longer on fine meshes. At "
":math:`48^3`, it took about 9 minutes with 4 MPI processes (about 2 "
"minutes with MV smearing)."

#: ../../kpoints/reproduction.rst:229
msgid "4. 出力のダウンロードと解析"
msgstr "4. Downloading and Analyzing the Output"

#: ../../kpoints/reproduction.rst:231
msgid ""
"各Jobの詳細画面の「ファイル」で「出力ファイル」に切り替え、「一括ダウンロード」でZIPを取得します。\\ "
"ダウンロードしたZIPを1つのフォルダ（例えば ``downloads`` "
"）に集め、そのフォルダを指定して解析スクリプトを実行します（ZIPを展開したフォルダを指定することもできます）。"
msgstr ""
"On each Job details page, open the \"Files\" tab, switch to \"Output "
"Files\", and use \"Batch Download\" to get the ZIP archive. \\ Put the "
"downloaded archives in one folder, such as ``downloads``, and run the "
"analysis script with that folder as its argument (you can also pass a "
"folder containing the extracted ZIP archives)."

#: ../../kpoints/reproduction.rst:234
msgid "python analyze_kpoints.py downloads"
msgstr "python analyze_kpoints.py downloads"

#: ../../kpoints/reproduction.rst:238
msgid ""
"スクリプトは、Jobの判定の結果を最初に表示し、続いて記事中の数値（表と、許容誤差に収まるメッシュ）を表示して、図を ``figures`` "
"フォルダに書き出します（ ``--figures`` で変更できます）。"
msgstr ""
"The script first lists the Jobs it identified, then prints the article's "
"numbers (the tables and the meshes that meet the tolerance), and writes "
"the figures to the ``figures`` folder (which you can change with "
"``--figures``)."

#: ../../kpoints/reproduction.rst:240
msgid "記事の数値と図は、上の「記事の計算の出力」のZIPを1つのフォルダに集めて、同じように実行すると得られます。"
msgstr ""
"You can reproduce the article's numbers and figures by putting the ZIP "
"archives from “Output from the Calculations in This Article” above in a "
"single folder and running the script the same way."

#: ../../kpoints/reproduction.rst:242
msgid "python analyze_kpoints.py data"
msgstr "python analyze_kpoints.py data"

#: ../../kpoints/reproduction.rst:246
msgid ""
"一部の計算だけを行った場合は、そのJobから求められる数値と図だけを出力します。\\ "
"参照値には、そのJobの系列で最も細かいメッシュの値を使うので、記事より粗いメッシュまでしか計算していない場合は、数値が記事と変わります。\\ "
"Jobの数を減らして試す場合は、例えばCu 3.64 Å（ :math:`n` = 8、12、16、24）とSi 5.47 Å（ "
":math:`n` = "
"4、6、8）をQuloudで計算し、配布した出力の同じ条件の値と全エネルギー・圧力が一致することを確かめてから、残りは配布した出力で解析する、という進め方ができます。"
msgstr ""
"If you ran only some of the calculations, the script outputs only the "
"numbers and figures it can obtain from those Jobs. \\ It takes each "
"reference value from the finest mesh in that series of Jobs, so if your "
"finest mesh is coarser than the one in the article, the numbers will "
"differ from the article. \\ If you want to run fewer Jobs, you can, for "
"example, compute Cu at 3.64 Å (:math:`n` = 8, 12, 16, and 24) and Si at "
"5.47 Å (:math:`n` = 4, 6, and 8) in Quloud, check that the total energies"
" and pressures agree with the supplied outputs for the same conditions, "
"and then use the supplied outputs to analyze the remaining cases."

#: ../../kpoints/reproduction.rst:250
msgid ""
"スクリプトは、フォルダの中のZIPを1つずつ開き、pw.xの出力（ ``Program PWSCF`` "
"を含むファイル）と、同じフォルダにある入力のコピー（ ``K_POINTS`` を含むファイル）から、次の内容を読み取ってJobを判定します。"
msgstr ""
"The script opens the ZIP archives in the folder one by one. To identify "
"each Job, it reads the information below from the pw.x output (the file "
"containing ``Program PWSCF``) and the copy of its input in the same "
"folder (the file containing ``K_POINTS``)."

#: ../../kpoints/reproduction.rst:252
msgid "元素と原子数、格子定数（出力の ``lattice parameter (alat)`` 。 ``ibrav = 2`` の場合は立方晶の格子定数）"
msgstr ""
"Elements, number of atoms, and lattice constant (``lattice parameter "
"(alat)`` in the output. With ``ibrav = 2``, this is the cubic lattice "
"constant)."

#: ../../kpoints/reproduction.rst:253
msgid "k点メッシュ :math:`n` （入力の ``K_POINTS automatic`` の行）"
msgstr "k-point mesh :math:`n` (the ``K_POINTS automatic`` line in the input)"

#: ../../kpoints/reproduction.rst:254
msgid "占有数（出力にテトラヘドロン法を使った旨が書かれていればその種類、スメアリングの幅が書かれていればその幅、どちらもなければ固定占有）"
msgstr ""
"Occupation numbers (the type of tetrahedron method if the output reports "
"one, the smearing width if reported, or fixed occupations if it reports "
"neither)"

#: ../../kpoints/reproduction.rst:256
msgid ""
"ZIPの名前やファイル名は判定に使わないので、ダウンロードしたままの名前で構いません。\\ "
"同じ条件のJobが複数あるときは、最初の1つだけを使います。"
msgstr ""
"The script does not use the ZIP archive or file names to identify Jobs, "
"so you can keep the downloaded names. \\ If several Jobs share the same "
"conditions, the script uses only the first."

#: ../../kpoints/reproduction.rst:260
msgid "計算と数値を扱う上での注意"
msgstr "Notes on Calculations and Numerical Results"

#: ../../kpoints/reproduction.rst:262
msgid ""
"**SCFの収束閾値と圧力。** Cu 3.64 Å・ :math:`12^3` で、SCF 収束閾値を1e-9 "
"Ryにすると、圧力は計算の設定（対称性の使い方、電荷密度の混合の割合）によって −11.27〜−12.35 kbarとばらつきました。1e-12 "
"Ryでは、どの設定でも −12.05±0.02 kbarにそろいました。全エネルギーは1e-9 "
"Ryでも8桁まで一致します。圧力を比べる計算では、閾値を厳しくしてください。"
msgstr ""
"**SCF convergence threshold and pressure.** For Cu at 3.64 Å and "
":math:`12^3`, a threshold of 1e-9 Ry gave pressures from −11.27 to −12.35"
" kbar depending on the calculation settings (use of symmetry and charge-"
"density mixing fraction). At 1e-12 Ry, all settings gave pressures of "
"−12.05 ± 0.02 kbar. The total energies agreed to 8 digits even at 1e-9 "
"Ry. Use a tighter threshold when comparing pressures."

#: ../../kpoints/reproduction.rst:263
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**対称性と既約k点。** 記事の計算では、すべてのJobでQEが48個の対称操作を見つけました（出力の ``48 Sym. Ops.`` "
"）。QuloudのVer.7.0.2より前のバージョンでは、fccの原始胞を ``ibrav = 5`` "
"（菱面体晶）として書くため、QEは12個の対称操作しか使わず、既約k点が多くなります（Cu :math:`12^3` "
"で189点。Ver.7.0.2以降は72点）。全エネルギーは :math:`10^{-8}` Ryの桁まで同じです。解析スクリプトは "
"``ibrav = 2`` の出力だけを読みます。"
msgstr ""
"**Symmetry and irreducible k-points.** QE found 48 symmetry operations in"
" every Job in this article (``48 Sym. Ops.`` in the output). Quloud "
"versions earlier than Ver. 7.0.2 wrote the fcc primitive cell as ``ibrav "
"= 5`` (rhombohedral), so QE used only 12 symmetry operations and the mesh"
" had more irreducible k-points (189 for Cu at :math:`12^3`, compared with"
" 72 in Ver. 7.0.2 and later). The total energies agree to :math:`10^{-8}`"
" Ry. The analysis script reads only output for ``ibrav = 2``."

#: ../../kpoints/reproduction.rst:264
msgid ""
"**参照値。** 全エネルギーの収束は、最も細かいメッシュ（Cu :math:`48^3` 、Si :math:`16^3` "
"）の値との差で評価しています。参照値自体の誤差は、Cuの :math:`40^3` と :math:`48^3` の差（0.003 "
"meV/atom、0.01 kbar）、Siの :math:`12^3` と :math:`16^3` の差（0.07 "
"meV/atom）程度です。スメアリング幅0.005 Ryの計算は、 :math:`48^3` でもまだ0.08 meV/atom、0.2 "
"kbar程度動いています。"
msgstr ""
"**Reference values.** We assess total energy convergence by comparing "
"with the value on the finest mesh (:math:`48^3` for Cu and :math:`16^3` "
"for Si). The errors in the reference values themselves are on the order "
"of the differences between :math:`40^3` and :math:`48^3` for Cu (0.003 "
"meV/atom and 0.01 kbar) and between :math:`12^3` and :math:`16^3` for Si "
"(0.07 meV/atom). At a smearing width of 0.005 Ry, the results still "
"change by about 0.08 meV/atom and 0.2 kbar even at :math:`48^3`."

#: ../../kpoints/reproduction.rst:265
msgid ""
"**計算時間。** 記事の時間は、WSL2のMPI 4並列で、QEの出力の最後の ``PWSCF`` "
"の行の経過時間（WALL）です。Quloudで実行すると、選んだインスタンスによって変わります。"
msgstr ""
"**Computation time.** The times in the article are the elapsed times "
"(WALL) on the final ``PWSCF`` line of the QE output, measured on WSL2 "
"with 4 MPI processes. When you run the calculations in Quloud, the time "
"depends on the instance you select."

